This directory contains sample datasets

Download data files from the following link: https://bioinfogp.cnb.csic.es/files/samples/rnaseq/

$ wget https://bioinfogp.cnb.csic.es/files/samples/rnaseq/RNA-Seq_Sample_Files.zip

$ unzip RNA-Seq_Sample_Files.zip

$ gunzip *.gz

